&lt;li&gt;Shape team identity and culture, and own accountability when problems occur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a team of engineers — setting direction with Product Managers, owning a backlog, and running delivery&lt;/li&gt;
